    "after": "default"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Now it's your turn – grab it! </h2>",
   "body": "<p>The complete range of tool clamping systems is now available in our web store. Find your perfect tool holder easily, quickly and conveniently and use the digital twin available there immediately in your CAM and tool management system.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/shop/tooling\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">To the tooling store</a></p>",
